WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,590 --> 00:00:05,510
Don't squeeze me here

2
00:00:05,510 --> 00:00:07,990
Which camps are you divided into? First, take shelter from the rain and have a boat.

3
00:00:09,870 --> 00:00:11,910
There must be a pool up there, so don't rush into it first.

4
00:00:11,910 --> 00:00:12,910
The boat may be unstable

5
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:18,980
Anyone can have it

6
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:20,380
Don't rely on yourself for a dozen people first

7
00:00:20,380 --> 00:00:21,420
It's not your ship

8
00:00:21,420 --> 00:00:22,540
So you can be the first to go

9
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:34,280
When the box comes out from under the bones, I'll put it back and you can take it yourself.

10
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:36,160
Isn’t it true that the person who sees it has a difference?

11
00:00:36,160 --> 00:00:37,120
Why are you missing?
